[INFO] 10-06 17:22:56 run_experiments_1.py:103] ## Step 2: Recall the properties of abelian groups
[INFO] 10-06 17:22:56 run_experiments_1.py:103] In an abelian group, the order of elements does not matter, and the group operation is commutative. This means that for any two elements g and h in the group, the order of their product is the same as their order.
